> @event
> for each "TouchButton"
>> @event
>> if NumberObjectVariable object="TouchButton" variable="Slot" comparison_sign=">=" value=200
>> if NumberObjectVariable object="TouchButton" variable="Slot" comparison_sign="<=" value=219
>> do SetX object="TouchButton" modification_sign="=" value=expr(PackGridX+mod(TouchButton.Variable(Slot)-200,PackColumns)*(PackCell+PackGap))
>> do SetY object="TouchButton" modification_sign="=" value=expr(PackGridY+floor((TouchButton.Variable(Slot)-200)/PackColumns)*(PackCell+PackGap))
>> do ResizableCapability::ResizableBehavior::SetSize object="TouchButton" behavior="Resizable" width=expr(PackCell) height=expr(PackCell)

